<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 30.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 30.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, June 30:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,718.60 (1,711.60)	CHF  1,192.50 (1,189.90)</p>
<p>    DEM    992.66 (990.62)	  GBP  2,863.50 (2,851.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    141.07 (140.77)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $34.95 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$26.49 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $61.44 million ($68.86 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
